de": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow. Niagara Falls is actually quite beautiful in the winter. I used to come here in the summer with my parents.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's too bad we only booked two nights here. Checkout time is soon.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, we'd better not go anywhere after all. A big snowstorm has just moved in.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: But I've been scheduled to work tomorrow!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Luckily, my boss is pretty flexible. To be honest, I don't think we should be on the road under these conditions."}, {"time": "26000", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As a kid, I used to love playing outside in the snow all day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We'd better book another night here, but we ought to do it now.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Peter, you're so decisive.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I'm just being realistic.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You might want to call Marco and put off lunch tomorrow.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, that self-absorbed nincompoop isn't going to like that."}, {"time": "44500", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Last winter, we watched so many movies when Boston was snowed in. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I used to binge-watch TV shows with my brother on snow days. We would watch <span class=\"italic\">24</span> back to back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  My old boyfriend used to be impulsive like that. We would watch all the <span class=\"italic\">Bourne</span> movies in one day."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Quick Coffee Break"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Snowed In"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It's too bad"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to show that you are sorry or feel bad about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally thought it was too bad they only booked two nights. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about a snowstorm."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "To plan or organize something at a certain time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa has been scheduled to work tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flexible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when you are willing to change or try different things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The boss was very flexible when making the schedule."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "realistic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to see things as they really are"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter was being realistic that they couldn't go home in the snowstorm."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "self-absorbed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to think only about yourself"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa thinks that Marco is self-absorbed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nincompoop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a foolish or stupid person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sometimes Marco acts like a nincompoop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Habits of the Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> express a pattern of action that occurred regularly in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Both <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> are followed the base form of a verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> + verb<br/><span class=\"italic\">I used to take a walk everyday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">would</span> + verb<br/><span class=\"italic\">I would walk 3 miles every evening.</span> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I used to binge-watch TV shows with my brother on snow days.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We would watch all the episodes back to back.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My old boyfriend used to be impulsive</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We would watch 3 movies in one day.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I used to love playing in the snow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would stay outside all afternoon.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Had Better</span>  and <span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> for what is Advisable"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> to give advice. You can also use <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> to express a recommendation. <br>You can use the contraction <span class=\"italic\">\u2018d better</span> when you speak."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"bullet\"><span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> is a strong request or advice.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We ought to make a reservation soon</span> = It's very good idea to do it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"bullet\"><span class=\"italic\">Might want to</span> is a suggestion</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You might want to call Marco to put off lunch tomorrow</span> = I suggest that you call Marco."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"bullet\"><span class=\"italic\">Had better</span> can be used as a strong recommendation, or warning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We'd better not drive anywhere in the snowstorm.</span> = I strongly recommend that we not drive anywhere because it's dangerous."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you are thinking of staying here for another night, you ought to call your boss."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'd better book another night in this hotel if we need to stay here longer."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le10ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine that you are somewhere indoors with your friends when it's raining hard all day and night."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Offer some advice to your friends on what they should do or not do. Use words to offer advice in your sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of activities including verbs that you could do together indoors."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange activity ideas with your partner. Communicate in English."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements to offer advice and solutions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compile a list of indoor activities with action words. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I exchange ideas with my partner."}]}]}